Comment: 0,0:05:33.16,0:05:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Then why didn't you speak to me in Farbani?
Comment: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Apologies.
Comment: 0,0:05:39.33,0:05:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I thought the language of the doreany\Nwould be more suited for a place like this.
Comment: 0,0:05:44.04,0:05:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Speak as you like. I don't care.
Comment: 0,0:10:15.00,0:10:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Arms of great strength.\NProtection of the war god.
